00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:52.640 line:20%
PATTIA CLUB

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:35.880 line:100%
<i>I do not believe that my dream</i>
<i>is just an illusion,</i>

00:03:37.120 --> 00:03:38.760 line:100%
<i>that there is no karma in this world.</i>

00:03:39.520 --> 00:03:41.880 line:100%
<i>If the ocean is meant to spill,</i>

00:03:41.960 --> 00:03:46.040 line:100%
<i>let the water of misery fill my heart.</i>

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:47.880 line:100%
<i>If far away I must go,</i>

00:03:47.960 --> 00:03:49.880 line:100%
<i>the storms I must weather.</i>

00:03:49.960 --> 00:03:51.720 line:100%
<i>All for freedom.</i>

00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:54.120 line:100%
<i>By Xu Meng.</i>

00:04:11.240 --> 00:04:12.600 line:100%
What a shocker.

00:04:12.680 --> 00:04:15.120 line:100%
All these smoke and mirrors
in superstition.

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:18.639 line:100%
In the end, it was all to run away
from debt collectors.

00:04:18.720 --> 00:04:21.480 line:100%
We should be more rational.

00:04:24.520 --> 00:04:25.920 line:100%
What's wrong?

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:27.720 line:100%
We solved the case. Why the long face?

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:32.280 line:100%
I'm wondering if this is the only answer.

00:04:32.360 --> 00:04:34.120 line:100%
How many answers do you need?

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:36.720 line:100%
Even in a comic book,
they always say there's only one truth.

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:52.360 line:100%
What is going on? A grand reception?

00:04:55.680 --> 00:04:56.520 line:20%
Captain.

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:57.560 line:20%
WEIYANG PUBLIC SECURITY BUREAU
NANSHAN BRANCH

00:04:57.640 --> 00:04:58.680 line:20%
Let's go.

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:01.360 line:100%
Captain Feng.

00:05:02.720 --> 00:05:03.720 line:100%
What's going on?

00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:08.960 line:100%
You two solved a big case today.

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:13.680 line:100%
-We solved a case?
-How did you know we solved the case?

00:05:13.760 --> 00:05:15.400 line:100%
I haven't even told you about it yet.

00:05:15.480 --> 00:05:18.640 line:100%
Didn't you ask me
to ambush the pickpocket?

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:23.760 line:100%
He did see a briefcase

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:26.520 line:100%
with Qingsong Cement written on it.

00:05:26.600 --> 00:05:28.680 line:100%
<i>It was hidden inside Wu Shanlong's house.</i>

00:05:29.320 --> 00:05:30.240 line:100%
What was inside?

00:05:30.880 --> 00:05:33.240 line:100%
Photocopies of the tender document
on Dongshan Mine.

00:05:33.320 --> 00:05:35.800 line:100%
Does it mean the case is solved now?

00:05:35.880 --> 00:05:37.720 line:100%
Wu Shanlong was the whistle-blower.

00:05:37.800 --> 00:05:41.000 line:100%
Song Qingsong paid Director Li of the mine

00:05:41.080 --> 00:05:43.600 line:100%
eight million yuan to win the bid.

00:05:43.680 --> 00:05:45.560 line:100%
Director Li sure is cunning.

00:05:45.640 --> 00:05:46.720 line:100%
He wants the best of both worlds.

00:05:46.800 --> 00:05:49.640 line:100%
He sold the tender
to both Song Qingsong and Cripple Du.

00:05:49.720 --> 00:05:51.760 line:100%
And in the end, they fought.

00:05:52.720 --> 00:05:55.480 line:100%
I get it now. Director Li
conducted this whole farce.

00:05:55.560 --> 00:05:57.560 line:100%
He said someone stole
the tender document from the mine.

00:05:57.640 --> 00:05:59.400 line:100%
In reality, he was
just diverting attention.

00:05:59.480 --> 00:06:00.440 line:100%
Exactly.

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:05.560 line:100%
Sir. We have good news too.

00:06:07.520 --> 00:06:09.400 line:100%
Is it about
the missing father and daughter?

00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:13.880 line:100%
They disappeared on purpose.
We have evidence.

00:06:16.080 --> 00:06:16.920 line:100%
Good things come in pairs.

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:19.080 line:100%
When I see the chief next time,

00:06:19.160 --> 00:06:21.800 line:100%
I'll put in a good word for you two.

00:06:21.880 --> 00:06:24.840 line:100%
Sir. There's no rush for that.

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:27.720 line:100%
But my secondment ends tomorrow.

00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:29.160 line:100%
I have to return to the police station.

00:06:29.240 --> 00:06:31.440 line:100%
About my secondment evaluation report…

00:06:36.360 --> 00:06:38.280 line:100%
Oh, He Yuanhang.

00:06:39.520 --> 00:06:40.520 line:100%
You're crafty.

00:06:41.560 --> 00:06:44.680 line:100%
Well, I have to bring something back
for that green-eyed colleague of mine.

00:06:44.760 --> 00:06:46.720 line:100%
Before you return tomorrow,

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:48.760 line:100%
bring me the case summary report,

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:51.240 line:100%
and you'll have your evaluation report.

00:06:53.160 --> 00:06:55.080 line:100%
Captain Feng, do I
have to write the report too?

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:58.960 line:100%
The quality of your report
will affect the quality of mine.

00:06:59.040 --> 00:07:00.120 line:100%
What?

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:02.360 line:100%
All the best.

00:07:03.600 --> 00:07:05.320 line:100%
But… Captain Feng.

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:07.560 line:100%
Tomorrow? I've stayed up late
for a few nights already.

00:07:13.480 --> 00:07:14.960 line:100%
He. Go back and rest up.

00:07:15.040 --> 00:07:16.360 line:100%
I'll write the report.

00:07:17.720 --> 00:07:18.960 line:100%
It's okay.

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:20.960 line:100%
Working late is part and parcel
of being a criminal detective.

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:22.400 line:100%
You know what? Go back and sleep.

00:07:22.480 --> 00:07:23.880 line:100%
Drop by my place tomorrow
at noon to check my report.

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:26.040 line:100%
You can also taste my wife's cooking.

00:07:26.120 --> 00:07:28.520 line:100%
-She'll make noodles for you. See you.
-Okay.

00:07:29.640 --> 00:07:31.520 line:100%
-Drive safely!
-Okay.

00:08:02.800 --> 00:08:05.360 line:100%
Help yourself.

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:07.760 line:100%
Sir,

00:08:08.520 --> 00:08:10.600 line:100%
I no longer eat coriander.

00:08:23.360 --> 00:08:24.440 line:100%
Sir,

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:27.440 line:100%
you're now retired.

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:29.200 line:100%
Xiaohe has also grown up.

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:31.680 line:100%
Why don't you just enjoy your retirement?

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:37.240 line:100%
Are you telling me to give up?

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:40.240 line:100%
No.

00:08:40.839 --> 00:08:42.320 line:100%
I'm telling you to accept
your current pace

00:08:42.400 --> 00:08:43.800 line:100%
and you may continue to be useful.

00:08:43.880 --> 00:08:45.400 line:100%
That's just giving up.

00:08:50.960 --> 00:08:52.760 line:100%
Back then, you told me

00:08:53.640 --> 00:08:56.480 line:100%
to let it go when it was time to do so
instead of dwelling on it.

00:08:56.560 --> 00:08:59.200 line:100%
Otherwise, we would…

00:09:04.680 --> 00:09:05.520 line:100%
Sir.

00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:09.840 line:100%
Don't visit Yuanlongli anymore.

00:09:12.600 --> 00:09:14.080 line:100%
I wanted to retire too back then.

00:09:14.800 --> 00:09:15.760 line:100%
But you had to drag me in.

00:09:16.400 --> 00:09:18.160 line:100%
Now, it's the other way round.

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:19.680 line:100%
Ran Fangxu.

00:09:19.760 --> 00:09:21.400 line:100%
Just be frank with me.

00:09:21.480 --> 00:09:23.040 line:100%
Are you going to pretend
for the rest of your life

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:26.080 line:100%
that the June 30th case never happened?

00:09:31.680 --> 00:09:33.200 line:100%
I made a wrong call back then.

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:34.760 line:100%
That was on me.

00:09:35.560 --> 00:09:37.760 line:100%
But it has been 18 years now.

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:39.400 line:100%
We've gone through every lead we had.

00:09:39.480 --> 00:09:40.880 line:100%
There are no new leads.

00:09:40.960 --> 00:09:42.400 line:100%
No new leads?

00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:43.680 line:100%
Come here.

00:09:43.760 --> 00:09:45.600 line:100%
-Sir.
-Come here.

00:09:46.240 --> 00:09:47.200 line:100%
No new leads?

00:09:47.280 --> 00:09:48.680 line:100%
No new leads? What is this?

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:51.160 line:100%
What is this?
What are these if not new leads?

00:09:51.240 --> 00:09:52.400 line:100%
Sir!

00:09:54.240 --> 00:09:57.160 line:100%
Why else do you think
I always visit Yuanlongli?

00:09:57.240 --> 00:09:59.960 line:100%
Because I know
it has the most important lead.

00:10:00.040 --> 00:10:02.480 line:100%
As long as Yuanlongli is still here,
the case can be solved.

00:10:02.560 --> 00:10:04.560 line:100%
Let it go already, sir.

00:10:04.640 --> 00:10:06.960 line:100%
No need to waste your life on one case.

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:09.840 line:100%
I can't! Just go away then.

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:11.360 line:100%
I'll just investigate it myself.

00:10:11.440 --> 00:10:12.280 line:100%
Sir.

00:10:18.520 --> 00:10:19.360 line:100%
Sir!

00:10:20.240 --> 00:10:22.440 line:100%
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

00:10:34.920 --> 00:10:36.280 line:100%
MISSING PERSON

00:10:37.560 --> 00:10:40.560 line:100%
Sir, what are you doing? Stop posting it.

00:10:41.640 --> 00:10:43.200 line:100%
If you can insist on quitting,

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:45.000 line:100%
let me insist on investigating as well.

00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:46.320 line:100%
We have nothing to do with each other.

00:10:49.640 --> 00:10:51.960 line:100%
Your posters serve no purpose, sir.

00:10:53.320 --> 00:10:55.000 line:100%
Just come back with me.

00:10:58.800 --> 00:10:59.960 line:100%
Sir.

00:11:00.640 --> 00:11:01.480 line:100%
Sir.

00:11:01.560 --> 00:11:04.000 line:100%
Many things don't come with answers.

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:05.360 line:100%
I don't want answers.

00:11:05.440 --> 00:11:06.680 line:100%
I want the truth.

00:11:06.760 --> 00:11:07.880 line:100%
Let go. Let go of me.

00:11:07.960 --> 00:11:09.040 line:100%
No!

00:11:09.120 --> 00:11:10.080 line:100%
I won't unless you come back.

00:11:10.160 --> 00:11:11.360 line:100%
I don't need you now. Let go.

00:11:11.440 --> 00:11:12.760 line:100%
-No.
-Let…

00:11:18.360 --> 00:11:19.200 line:100%
Who's there?

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:22.520 line:100%
Dad? What are you doing?

00:11:25.240 --> 00:11:26.080 line:100%
Xiaohe.

00:11:32.400 --> 00:11:34.640 line:100%
Xiaohe. Don't leave.

00:11:34.720 --> 00:11:36.720 line:100%
Look. We're already here anyway.

00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:40.440 line:100%
Maybe you, Uncle Ran, and I
can investigate this case together.

00:11:40.520 --> 00:11:42.440 line:100%
I can't monitor you all the time.
I can't chain you to a post.

00:11:42.520 --> 00:11:43.680 line:100%
I can't stop you.

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:45.120 line:100%
Whenever I go out,
you sneak into Yuanlongli.

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:47.440 line:100%
What if you fall sick again?

00:11:48.360 --> 00:11:50.280 line:100%
Sick? Look at me.

00:11:50.360 --> 00:11:51.680 line:100%
The very picture of health.

00:11:53.560 --> 00:11:57.600 line:100%
Dad. I have work to do. Please

00:11:59.120 --> 00:12:00.840 line:100%
go back with Uncle Ran.

00:12:01.560 --> 00:12:02.840 line:100%
She's right.

00:12:02.920 --> 00:12:04.480 line:100%
-Let's go, sir.
-Shut up.

00:12:05.400 --> 00:12:06.640 line:100%
Xiaohe.

00:12:06.720 --> 00:12:08.520 line:100%
You're here to find evidence

00:12:08.600 --> 00:12:11.000 line:100%
to appeal against
Han Zi'ang's expulsion, aren't you?

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:13.160 line:100%
Since Uncle Ran and I are here,

00:12:13.240 --> 00:12:14.680 line:100%
we can assist you.

00:12:14.760 --> 00:12:15.800 line:100%
I don't need your help.

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:19.240 line:100%
Our investigation skills are exceptional.

00:12:19.320 --> 00:12:20.440 line:100%
I don't need you.

00:12:20.520 --> 00:12:22.600 line:100%
I can swear. I can swear

00:12:23.320 --> 00:12:26.120 line:100%
that if we fail to find anything useful,

00:12:26.200 --> 00:12:27.320 line:100%
we will leave right away.

00:12:27.400 --> 00:12:29.000 line:100%
We won't disturb you when you work.

00:12:34.760 --> 00:12:36.720 line:100%
What… What

00:12:37.560 --> 00:12:38.520 line:100%
can you two do anyway?

00:12:39.640 --> 00:12:40.720 line:100%
Right?

00:12:41.680 --> 00:12:43.280 line:100%
I have no idea either.

00:12:43.360 --> 00:12:44.360 line:100%
Don't play dumb.

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:49.280 line:100%
You know what?

00:12:49.360 --> 00:12:51.160 line:100%
Take… Take the helmet for me.

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:55.400 line:100%
Stay here. Don't move. Come. Follow me.

00:12:56.720 --> 00:12:57.920 line:100%
Where are you going?

00:12:58.000 --> 00:13:00.000 line:100%
Just stay there. Don't move.

00:13:07.240 --> 00:13:08.400 line:20%
MISSING PERSONS

00:13:12.480 --> 00:13:16.480 line:100%
He Xiaohe. How can you believe
the words of a madman?

00:13:19.960 --> 00:13:21.960 line:100%
-Run! Quick.
-What's going on?

00:13:22.040 --> 00:13:23.800 line:100%
Quick! Quick!

00:13:23.880 --> 00:13:25.960 line:100%
-It's dangerous. Move aside.
-Who's chasing after you?

00:13:26.040 --> 00:13:27.200 line:100%
Careful.

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:28.720 line:100%
Dad! Who's pursuing you?

00:13:28.800 --> 00:13:30.120 line:100%
-Careful.
-Dad!

00:13:39.200 --> 00:13:40.040 line:100%
Dad!

00:13:47.560 --> 00:13:49.360 line:100%
What are you trying to do?

00:13:49.440 --> 00:13:50.440 line:100%
Who is pursuing you?

00:13:58.880 --> 00:14:02.280 line:100%
Re-enactment is so effective.

00:14:02.360 --> 00:14:05.480 line:100%
Dad. Can you stop messing around?

00:14:07.800 --> 00:14:09.600 line:100%
This is called a re-enactment.

00:14:09.680 --> 00:14:12.280 line:100%
It's Uncle Ran's expertise.

00:14:12.360 --> 00:14:13.840 line:100%
Re-enactment?

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:17.800 line:100%
Put yourself in the shoes of Han Zi'ang

00:14:17.880 --> 00:14:19.760 line:100%
and re-enact what he did.

00:14:19.840 --> 00:14:22.880 line:100%
Then, find clues during the process.

00:14:22.960 --> 00:14:26.880 line:100%
You're saying
that Han Zi'ang wasn't lying in ambush.

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:29.040 line:100%
Someone was pursuing him.

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:33.440 line:100%
That was why he hid in the cupboard.

00:14:35.760 --> 00:14:36.640 line:100%
Where's your proof?

00:14:39.880 --> 00:14:42.240 line:100%
Uncle Ran is back. He'll answer you.

00:14:42.880 --> 00:14:43.720 line:100%
No need for that.

00:14:44.880 --> 00:14:47.760 line:100%
Xiaohe is smart enough
to deduce it herself.

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:50.680 line:100%
Did you get it then?

00:15:38.920 --> 00:15:40.080 line:100%
Help!

00:15:40.800 --> 00:15:43.600 line:100%
Help! Help!

00:15:45.400 --> 00:15:46.880 line:100%
Help!

00:15:49.680 --> 00:15:50.960 line:100%
Help!

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:09.000 line:100%
I hear a ghost.

00:16:18.680 --> 00:16:19.600 line:100%
Where is it?

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:21.160 line:100%
Over there.

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:39.880 line:100%
Han Zi'ang might have
been assaulted first.

00:16:39.960 --> 00:16:41.200 line:100%
Then, he fled.

00:16:41.280 --> 00:16:42.400 line:100%
Fearing assault,

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:45.520 line:100%
he acted out of self-defense
after he hid in the cupboard.

00:16:49.080 --> 00:16:49.960 line:100%
Xiaohe.

00:16:50.960 --> 00:16:53.040 line:100%
This is your logical deduction.

00:16:53.600 --> 00:16:56.720 line:100%
You'll have to find the evidence yourself.

00:16:57.640 --> 00:16:59.280 line:100%
Understood?

00:16:59.360 --> 00:17:00.720 line:100%
You have to rely on yourself.

00:17:01.720 --> 00:17:05.080 line:100%
Sir. You've seen how Xiaohe did just now.

00:17:05.159 --> 00:17:06.360 line:100%
Yes.

00:17:07.320 --> 00:17:10.000 line:100%
It exceeded my expectations.

00:17:10.080 --> 00:17:12.680 line:100%
I know she is a capable officer,

00:17:13.560 --> 00:17:14.879 line:100%
and I can't wait to see her
solve this case.

00:17:17.159 --> 00:17:19.760 line:100%
Are you saying
that you still want to quit?

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:22.399 line:100%
Sir,

00:17:23.680 --> 00:17:26.080 line:100%
I will wait for Xiaohe's
good news in Beijing.

00:17:27.360 --> 00:17:29.640 line:100%
Then, I'll insert this case
into my teaching material.

00:17:30.800 --> 00:17:32.000 line:100%
You're going back to Beijing?

00:17:32.680 --> 00:17:33.560 line:100%
Yes.

00:17:50.400 --> 00:17:51.240 line:100%
Dad.

00:17:52.320 --> 00:17:53.280 line:100%
It'll be dawn soon.

00:17:54.640 --> 00:17:57.200 line:100%
Uncle Ran has to catch the train.

00:18:14.560 --> 00:18:17.240 line:100%
Let's go. I'll give you
a lift to the train station.

00:18:19.480 --> 00:18:20.360 line:100%
Okay.

00:18:40.800 --> 00:18:42.480 line:20%
AWARDED TO HE YUANHANG

00:18:42.560 --> 00:18:45.840 line:20%
OUTSTANDING POLICE OFFICER
OF NANSHAN DISTRICT

00:18:48.120 --> 00:18:51.360 line:100%
…THE STORMS I MUST WEATHER
ALL FOR FREEDOM. XU MENG

00:19:09.440 --> 00:19:12.840 line:100%
YUANLONGLI JUNE 30TH CASE, SUMMARY REPORT

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:18.880 line:100%
<i>On August 24th, 1995,</i>

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:22.160 line:100%
<i>Xu Zhihong, father, and Xu Meng, daughter,</i>

00:19:22.240 --> 00:19:24.040 line:100%
<i>were involved in an accident on Mount Wu.</i>

00:19:24.120 --> 00:19:26.480 line:100%
<i>Xu Zhihong suffered severe injuries</i>

00:19:26.560 --> 00:19:27.400 line:100%
-What's the matter?
-<i>and had to seek</i>

00:19:27.480 --> 00:19:28.640 line:100%
<i>long-term medical treatment.</i>

00:19:29.160 --> 00:19:30.160 line:100%
Dad!

00:19:30.720 --> 00:19:32.360 line:100%
Dad! Dad!

00:19:32.960 --> 00:19:35.080 line:100%
Save my dad. He fainted.

00:19:35.160 --> 00:19:37.160 line:100%
Save my dad. Save my dad.

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:43.000 line:100%
<i>Xu Meng pawned her assets</i>
<i>and took out loans</i>

00:19:43.600 --> 00:19:45.000 line:100%
<i>to pay for her father's medical bills.</i>

00:19:48.440 --> 00:19:52.720 line:20%
IOU, XU MENG

00:20:00.760 --> 00:20:02.120 line:100%
Didn't you say 8,000 yuan?

00:20:02.720 --> 00:20:03.760 line:100%
How come there's only 6,000 yuan?

00:20:03.840 --> 00:20:06.080 line:100%
You think I don't need
the handling fee? Huh?

00:20:08.000 --> 00:20:09.400 line:100%
Don't just stand there.

00:20:10.920 --> 00:20:13.080 line:100%
-Pay up now! Pay up!
-Pay up now!

00:20:13.160 --> 00:20:15.280 line:100%
-Pay up!
-Pay up now! Pay up!

00:20:15.360 --> 00:20:16.960 line:100%
-Pay up now!
-Pay up!

00:20:17.040 --> 00:20:18.040 line:100%
-Pay up!
-Pay up!

00:20:18.120 --> 00:20:18.960 line:100%
-Pay up now!
-Pay up!

00:20:19.040 --> 00:20:21.000 line:100%
<i>As the Xus accumulated debts,</i>

00:20:21.080 --> 00:20:23.440 line:100%
-<i>debt collectors visited them more often.</i>
-Pay up!

00:20:23.520 --> 00:20:24.520 line:100%
<i>They shouted threats,</i>

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:27.240 line:100%
<i>pushing the victims into desperation.</i>

00:20:27.320 --> 00:20:28.640 line:100%
-Pay up!
-Yes, pay up!

00:20:28.720 --> 00:20:30.320 line:100%
-Pay up, Xu Meng!
-Xu Meng!

00:20:30.400 --> 00:20:32.840 line:100%
-I know you're in there.
-Just come

00:20:34.320 --> 00:20:35.600 line:100%
after me, you punks!

00:20:35.680 --> 00:20:37.240 line:100%
Old cripple, come out now.

00:20:37.320 --> 00:20:39.600 line:100%
-Get out now!
-Don't harass my daughter!

00:20:39.680 --> 00:20:40.840 line:100%
-If you can stay in there,
-Stay put.

00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:42.720 line:100%
-come out and pay up now.
-It's okay.

00:20:42.800 --> 00:20:43.920 line:100%
-It's okay.
-Pay up!

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:45.760 line:100%
-Pay up!
-Bullying a girl now?

00:20:45.840 --> 00:20:47.720 line:100%
-Come out now!
-Are you even men?

00:20:47.800 --> 00:20:48.720 line:100%
<i>Our investigation</i>

00:20:49.320 --> 00:20:51.680 line:100%
<i>indicates that Xu Meng</i>
<i>defrauded many people</i>

00:20:51.760 --> 00:20:54.000 line:100%
<i>by repeatedly mortgaging her property.</i>

00:20:54.800 --> 00:20:56.960 line:100%
<i>They had the motive to run away</i>

00:20:57.040 --> 00:21:00.480 line:100%
<i>from their debt collectors and pursuers.</i>

00:21:05.800 --> 00:21:06.800 line:100%
Mengmeng,

00:21:08.960 --> 00:21:10.320 line:100%
death

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:12.960 line:100%
is

00:21:14.760 --> 00:21:17.200 line:100%
our only solution.

00:21:22.200 --> 00:21:23.160 line:100%
Dad,

00:21:24.560 --> 00:21:25.920 line:100%
I don't want to die.

00:21:27.640 --> 00:21:29.040 line:100%
Let's run away, okay?

00:21:30.320 --> 00:21:31.880 line:100%
We'll disappear in Weiyang.

00:21:35.000 --> 00:21:36.240 line:100%
<i>Vanishing in Weiyang</i>

00:21:36.920 --> 00:21:39.400 line:100%
<i>became their only way out.</i>

00:21:44.520 --> 00:21:47.160 line:100%
<i>According to the testimony</i>
<i>of Du Mandun, a Yuanlongli resident,</i>

00:21:47.840 --> 00:21:49.800 line:100%
<i>Xu Meng visited the New York Block</i>

00:21:49.880 --> 00:21:53.360 line:100%
<i>to devise her escape route</i>
<i>before she executed her plan.</i>

00:21:58.320 --> 00:22:00.880 line:100%
<i>Elevators are operated</i>
<i>by the same generic key.</i>

00:22:00.960 --> 00:22:03.440 line:100%
<i>Having worked in Dajianchang</i>
<i>for many years,</i>

00:22:04.040 --> 00:22:07.040 line:100%
<i>Xu Zhihong was familiar</i>
<i>with tools and could make keys.</i>

00:22:08.360 --> 00:22:12.160 line:100%
<i>Additionally, the Xus</i>
<i>also picked the date carefully.</i>

00:22:12.240 --> 00:22:13.440 line:100%
<i>They opted for a day when the residents</i>

00:22:13.520 --> 00:22:15.960 line:100%
<i>would be watching the reunification</i>
<i>of Hong Kong broadcast.</i>

00:22:16.040 --> 00:22:19.880 line:100%
<i>The absence of people on the street</i>
<i>facilitated their escape plan.</i>

00:22:19.960 --> 00:22:22.760 line:100%
<i>At around 4:30 p.m., June 30th,</i>

00:22:22.840 --> 00:22:24.320 line:100%
<i>Xu Meng carried Xu Zhihong on her back</i>

00:22:24.400 --> 00:22:26.000 line:100%
<i>and arrived at Yuanlongli.</i>

00:22:26.880 --> 00:22:28.800 line:100%
<i>At 4:38 p.m.,</i>

00:22:28.880 --> 00:22:32.040 line:100%
<i>Xu Meng and Xu Zhihong</i>
<i>took the elevator to the 18th floor.</i>

00:22:32.960 --> 00:22:34.720 line:100%
<i>Before they exited the elevator,</i>

00:22:34.800 --> 00:22:37.160 line:100%
<i>Xu Zhihong pressed all the buttons</i>
<i>in the elevator.</i>

00:22:49.680 --> 00:22:52.840 line:100%
<i>After they left the elevator,</i>
<i>they split up.</i>

00:22:53.600 --> 00:22:56.560 line:100%
<i>When the elevator stopped briefly</i>
<i>on the 17th floor,</i>

00:22:56.640 --> 00:22:59.440 line:100%
<i>Xu Meng went to 1813</i>
<i>and hung the black cloak.</i>

00:23:00.320 --> 00:23:02.680 line:100%
<i>Xu Zhihong then unlocked</i>
<i>the door to the elevator shaft.</i>

00:23:13.680 --> 00:23:15.200 line:100%
<i>They worked together</i>

00:23:15.280 --> 00:23:17.160 line:100%
<i>and dragged two wooden planks</i>
<i>with their footprints</i>

00:23:17.760 --> 00:23:19.360 line:100%
<i>to the top of the elevator.</i>

00:23:25.760 --> 00:23:26.600 line:100%
<i>Preliminary analysis shows</i>

00:23:26.680 --> 00:23:29.320 line:100%
<i>that Xu Meng's and Xu Zhihong's</i>
<i>footprints, handprints</i>

00:23:29.400 --> 00:23:31.040 line:100%
<i>collected on the elevator roof,</i>

00:23:31.120 --> 00:23:32.680 line:100%
<i>and even the handwriting in the letter,</i>

00:23:32.760 --> 00:23:36.640 line:100%
<i>match the ones collected</i>
<i>in their place of residence.</i>

00:23:37.640 --> 00:23:40.160 line:100%
Dad. We must live on.

00:23:40.760 --> 00:23:41.680 line:100%
Don't be scared.

00:24:00.600 --> 00:24:02.560 line:100%
<i>When the elevator stopped</i>
<i>on the first floor,</i>

00:24:02.640 --> 00:24:05.360 line:100%
<i>the Xus unlocked</i>
<i>the elevator door from the shaft</i>

00:24:05.440 --> 00:24:07.000 line:100%
<i>and arrived at the lobby</i>
<i>on the second floor.</i>

00:24:32.360 --> 00:24:35.440 line:100%
<i>They took the eastern staircase</i>
<i>and headed to B1.</i>

00:24:36.800 --> 00:24:38.880 line:100%
<i>It is connected</i>
<i>to the underground car park.</i>

00:24:39.600 --> 00:24:41.480 line:100%
<i>When Xu Meng worked in Pattia,</i>

00:24:41.560 --> 00:24:43.880 line:100%
<i>she got her hands on the keys</i>
<i>to the underground car park.</i>

00:25:06.280 --> 00:25:09.880 line:100%
YUANLONGLI UNDERGROUND PARKING LOT

00:25:38.440 --> 00:25:41.680 line:100%
<i>They took the car park exit</i>
<i>and left Yuanlongli.</i>

00:25:42.240 --> 00:25:44.280 line:100%
<i>That route was not covered</i>
<i>by security cameras.</i>

00:25:45.160 --> 00:25:48.720 line:100%
<i>The Xus mystified their disappearance</i>

00:25:48.800 --> 00:25:50.920 line:100%
<i>so that rumors would spread.</i>

00:25:51.000 --> 00:25:52.200 line:100%
<i>The superstitious beliefs</i>

00:25:52.280 --> 00:25:54.840 line:100%
<i>would also deter their debt collectors</i>
<i>from coming closer,</i>

00:25:54.920 --> 00:25:57.560 line:100%
<i>thereby giving up on pursuing them.</i>

00:26:01.640 --> 00:26:04.920 line:20%
<i>In conclusion,</i>
<i>this is a premeditated, voluntary</i>

00:26:05.000 --> 00:26:07.120 line:100%
<i>missing person case motivated</i>
<i>by the desire to evade debt collection.</i>

00:26:16.080 --> 00:26:18.120 line:100%
<i>Should any request to locate them be made,</i>

00:26:18.200 --> 00:26:20.240 line:100%
<i>we recommend requesting the city council</i>

00:26:20.320 --> 00:26:22.440 line:100%
<i>to enlarge the search scope.</i>

00:26:38.520 --> 00:26:40.440 line:20%
WRITTEN BY, TIME

00:26:50.360 --> 00:26:52.360 line:100%
<i>Written by Ran Fangxu,</i>

00:26:53.840 --> 00:26:54.840 line:100%
<i>He Yuanhang.</i>

00:26:55.880 --> 00:26:57.680 line:20%
WRITTEN BY: RAN FANGXU, HE YUANHANG
TIME: JULY 5TH, 1997

00:27:18.000 --> 00:27:19.000 line:100%
Hi, Uncle Ran.

00:27:19.080 --> 00:27:21.000 line:100%
-Hi, Xiaohe.
-You're here.

00:27:21.720 --> 00:27:22.680 line:100%
Allow me to introduce him.

00:27:22.760 --> 00:27:25.000 line:100%
Ran. R-A-N.

00:27:25.080 --> 00:27:26.280 line:100%
Ran Fangxu.

00:27:26.360 --> 00:27:29.800 line:100%
And this one is my wife,
Sun Yun. Director Sun.

00:27:29.880 --> 00:27:32.040 line:100%
-Hi, Mrs. He.
-Hi, Ran.

00:27:33.000 --> 00:27:35.280 line:100%
-This is for you.
-You didn't have to.

00:27:35.360 --> 00:27:38.040 line:100%
Come in. Let me serve the noodles.

00:27:38.880 --> 00:27:39.840 line:100%
Take the shoes.

00:27:41.280 --> 00:27:44.680 line:100%
-Uncle Ran, your sandals.
-Thank you, Xiaohe. This is for you.

00:27:45.280 --> 00:27:46.800 line:100%
What is that?

00:27:48.240 --> 00:27:49.520 line:100%
Oh. A doll.

00:27:49.600 --> 00:27:51.200 line:100%
Thank you, Uncle Ran.

00:27:54.160 --> 00:27:56.360 line:100%
They both have something. Is this mine?

00:28:01.600 --> 00:28:04.280 line:100%
A freebie when I bought
the gift for your wife.

00:28:05.200 --> 00:28:06.920 line:100%
A freebie? I like it.

00:28:09.520 --> 00:28:10.360 line:100%
It suits me.

00:28:11.040 --> 00:28:12.440 line:100%
Come. Come.

00:28:18.680 --> 00:28:19.760 line:100%
Here.

00:28:20.680 --> 00:28:21.520 line:100%
Take a seat.

00:28:23.520 --> 00:28:25.480 line:100%
Make sure you don't tell my wife later

00:28:25.560 --> 00:28:26.760 line:100%
that I'm going back to the police station.

00:28:27.360 --> 00:28:28.760 line:100%
But aren't you going back tomorrow?

00:28:29.600 --> 00:28:32.160 line:100%
-You haven't told your wife?
-The noodles are ready.

00:28:33.720 --> 00:28:34.560 line:100%
Come.

00:28:35.760 --> 00:28:37.040 line:100%
How nice.

00:28:38.000 --> 00:28:41.520 line:100%
Listen. My wife cooked
a whole table of food for you.

00:28:41.600 --> 00:28:42.480 line:100%
Sorry for the hassle, Mrs. He.

00:28:42.560 --> 00:28:43.960 line:100%
Not a hassle at all. Take a seat.

00:28:44.040 --> 00:28:45.000 line:100%
Okay.

00:28:47.160 --> 00:28:48.360 line:100%
It smells divine.

00:28:48.920 --> 00:28:52.440 line:100%
Dad told me
Uncle Ran likes coriander best.

00:28:52.520 --> 00:28:54.520 line:100%
I washed them all myself.

00:28:55.600 --> 00:28:56.920 line:100%
Thank you, Xiaohe.

00:28:58.160 --> 00:28:59.440 line:100%
Come. Let's have a toast.

00:28:59.520 --> 00:29:02.080 line:100%
-Welcome to our humble abode, Ran.
-Thank you, Mrs. He.

00:29:02.160 --> 00:29:03.920 line:100%
-You're welcome.
-Welcome.

00:29:08.040 --> 00:29:08.880 line:100%
He Yuanhang.

00:29:09.680 --> 00:29:11.320 line:100%
Are you hiding something from me?

00:29:14.360 --> 00:29:16.080 line:100%
Why would I be hiding something from you?

00:29:17.160 --> 00:29:19.440 line:100%
Didn't you say Ran was your apprentice?

00:29:19.520 --> 00:29:22.120 line:100%
So isn't it a bit inappropriate for him
to call me Mrs. He?

00:29:24.520 --> 00:29:25.840 line:100%
It sounds younger that way.

00:29:25.920 --> 00:29:27.800 line:100%
Madam Sun sounds way older.

00:29:27.880 --> 00:29:30.840 line:100%
Lie. Lie more.

00:29:31.560 --> 00:29:34.000 line:100%
Ran is a top scorer from PPSUC.

00:29:34.080 --> 00:29:35.920 line:100%
You're here for a secondment.

00:29:36.000 --> 00:29:37.920 line:100%
There's no way he's your apprentice.

00:29:38.880 --> 00:29:40.120 line:100%
Right, Ran?

00:29:45.720 --> 00:29:47.200 line:100%
He

00:29:48.200 --> 00:29:49.400 line:100%
is indeed my mentor.

00:29:52.920 --> 00:29:54.200 line:100%
Did you hear that?

00:29:55.280 --> 00:29:57.520 line:100%
Feng did this?

00:30:00.320 --> 00:30:02.040 line:100%
-Eat more.
-Thank you, Mrs. He.

00:30:02.120 --> 00:30:05.360 line:100%
You can hardly find a down-to-earth
young man nowadays.

00:30:05.960 --> 00:30:08.880 line:100%
You're smart, capable,
and have the required qualification.

00:30:08.960 --> 00:30:11.920 line:100%
I'm sure your workplace
will invest a lot in you.

00:30:13.040 --> 00:30:15.240 line:100%
He will stay at the criminal department.

00:30:15.320 --> 00:30:18.800 line:100%
Ran, you will support him, won't you?

00:30:21.640 --> 00:30:23.560 line:100%
Actually, the criminal department
has a heavy workload.

00:30:23.640 --> 00:30:25.560 line:100%
Even heavier than a bank.

00:30:25.640 --> 00:30:26.560 line:100%
Xiaohe is still young.

00:30:26.640 --> 00:30:27.880 line:100%
She needs her parents.

00:30:27.960 --> 00:30:29.600 line:100%
Yes, Dad.

00:30:29.680 --> 00:30:31.080 line:100%
I need my parents.

00:30:31.680 --> 00:30:32.520 line:100%
For what?

00:30:35.160 --> 00:30:37.520 line:100%
The biggest thing a father can do
for his children

00:30:37.600 --> 00:30:39.120 line:100%
is to be a great role model,

00:30:39.200 --> 00:30:41.640 line:100%
not to keep them company.

00:30:44.320 --> 00:30:45.520 line:100%
Don't you agree, Ran?

00:30:47.600 --> 00:30:50.040 line:100%
Yes. You're right.

00:30:50.120 --> 00:30:51.280 line:100%
Oh, Ran.

00:30:52.000 --> 00:30:53.320 line:100%
Are you single?

00:30:53.400 --> 00:30:55.560 line:100%
I know many single women in my work.

00:30:55.640 --> 00:30:56.520 line:100%
Do you want me to introduce
some of them to you?

00:30:56.600 --> 00:30:59.480 line:100%
Uncle Ran doesn't need that.

00:30:59.560 --> 00:31:01.200 line:100%
I know Ms. Qiao.

00:31:01.280 --> 00:31:02.880 line:100%
She likes Uncle Ran.

00:31:02.960 --> 00:31:04.960 line:100%
She's so pretty.

00:31:05.680 --> 00:31:08.080 line:100%
Where does she work? She's quick.

00:31:09.000 --> 00:31:09.960 line:100%
Mrs. He.

00:31:10.040 --> 00:31:11.840 line:100%
I just arrived in Weiyang.

00:31:11.920 --> 00:31:12.960 line:100%
I just want to focus on my work.

00:31:13.040 --> 00:31:15.200 line:100%
I don't have time for anything else.

00:31:18.040 --> 00:31:19.600 line:100%
Sir.

00:31:20.560 --> 00:31:22.720 line:100%
How did the case report go?

00:31:23.320 --> 00:31:25.120 line:100%
Oh. It's almost done.

00:31:25.200 --> 00:31:27.080 line:100%
But I'm not so sure about certain details.

00:31:27.160 --> 00:31:28.680 line:100%
Can you help me?

00:31:28.760 --> 00:31:31.440 line:100%
-You can read it after the meal.
-It won't take long. Work comes first.

00:31:31.520 --> 00:31:32.680 line:100%
Come. Take a look.

00:31:32.760 --> 00:31:34.640 line:100%
We'll be back soon. Soon.

00:31:42.760 --> 00:31:44.560 line:100%
Stop playing with it. Eat.

00:31:54.840 --> 00:31:57.920 line:100%
SHE LEFT A LETTER. "I DO NOT BELIEVE
THAT MY DREAM IS JUST AN ILLUSION…"

00:32:03.400 --> 00:32:07.200 line:100%
Where do you think they are right now?

00:32:11.080 --> 00:32:12.920 line:100%
It's the first case of your life.

00:32:13.000 --> 00:32:16.160 line:100%
Are you lamenting the fact
that you can't find them?

00:32:18.760 --> 00:32:22.160 line:100%
No. Humans can adapt to many things.

00:32:22.760 --> 00:32:24.960 line:100%
As long as they live a good life
where they are right now.

00:32:32.560 --> 00:32:34.960 line:100%
It's good. Very thorough.

00:32:35.040 --> 00:32:37.440 line:100%
I wouldn't have been able
to word it so vividly.

00:32:38.040 --> 00:32:40.480 line:100%
Of course. I'm your mentor after all.

00:32:41.280 --> 00:32:43.120 line:100%
Mr. He Yuanhang.

00:32:43.200 --> 00:32:45.240 line:100%
Humility is often a virtue.

00:32:45.320 --> 00:32:46.920 line:100%
Mr. Ran Fangxu.

00:32:47.000 --> 00:32:49.120 line:100%
Humility in excess is arrogance.

00:32:54.120 --> 00:32:55.480 line:20%
WRITTEN BY: RAN FANGXU, HE YUANHANG
TIME: JULY 5TH, 1997

00:33:00.920 --> 00:33:03.400 line:100%
-What's wrong?
-The name sequence is wrong.

00:33:03.480 --> 00:33:04.920 line:100%
No need for that.

00:33:05.000 --> 00:33:06.000 line:100%
-He.
-It's fine.

00:33:06.080 --> 00:33:07.680 line:100%
We must be truthful.

00:33:07.760 --> 00:33:10.040 line:100%
I am being truthful. Listen.

00:33:10.120 --> 00:33:11.080 line:100%
Investigation-wise,

00:33:11.160 --> 00:33:13.480 line:100%
you are the main contributor
who solved this case.

00:33:13.560 --> 00:33:16.920 line:100%
And in terms of your career,
you will stay in the criminal department.

00:33:17.000 --> 00:33:18.720 line:100%
Whereas I will return
to the police station.

00:33:18.800 --> 00:33:20.320 line:100%
-The sequence of our names
-Sir.

00:33:20.400 --> 00:33:21.400 line:100%
-does not matter.
-Sir.

00:33:21.480 --> 00:33:23.240 line:100%
Let me finish. It does not matter.

00:33:23.320 --> 00:33:25.600 line:100%
Tomorrow, I'll take the evaluation
report Captain Feng gives me

00:33:25.680 --> 00:33:27.000 line:100%
and return to the police station.

00:33:27.080 --> 00:33:30.720 line:100%
I want to show Qu Dahai just how…

00:33:52.240 --> 00:33:54.800 line:100%
-Why didn't you tell me?
-I tried.

00:33:54.880 --> 00:33:56.840 line:100%
-What did you say?
-Sir.

00:34:09.680 --> 00:34:10.880 line:100%
My wife is like this.

00:34:11.600 --> 00:34:13.240 line:100%
She gets angry very fast,
but she also forgets about it very fast.

00:34:13.320 --> 00:34:14.680 line:100%
She'll be fine in a few days.

00:34:15.920 --> 00:34:17.039 line:100%
He.

00:34:18.320 --> 00:34:20.760 line:100%
Have you ever considered staying?

00:34:23.200 --> 00:34:24.320 line:100%
Of course I have.

00:34:24.920 --> 00:34:26.560 line:100%
Why didn't you wait for me?

00:34:26.640 --> 00:34:28.600 line:100%
I want to see Uncle Ran off too.

00:34:28.680 --> 00:34:31.360 line:100%
Naughty girl! The floor is cold.
You came out without shoes.

00:34:31.439 --> 00:34:33.240 line:100%
Wear your shoes. Come.

00:34:35.640 --> 00:34:36.959 line:100%
You're here anyway.

00:34:37.039 --> 00:34:38.999 line:100%
Why should I wear my shoes?

00:34:39.080 --> 00:34:41.240 line:100%
Look at you. Your soles are dirty.

00:34:41.320 --> 00:34:43.160 line:100%
When mom sees that, she'll scold you.

00:34:43.240 --> 00:34:44.560 line:100%
Wash your feet when you go back.

00:34:44.640 --> 00:34:46.400 line:100%
Okay. You have to teach me

00:34:46.479 --> 00:34:48.560 line:100%
the 10th move of the evil-subduing
fist technique tonight.

00:34:48.640 --> 00:34:49.920 line:100%
Of course.

00:34:51.519 --> 00:34:52.760 line:100%
You see.

00:34:52.840 --> 00:34:55.519 line:100%
I don't have a huge ambition.

00:34:55.600 --> 00:34:56.800 line:100%
I understand.

00:34:56.880 --> 00:34:58.000 line:100%
He.

00:35:00.760 --> 00:35:02.040 line:100%
This isn't half bad either.

00:35:06.720 --> 00:35:08.040 line:100%
Come. Let's see Uncle Ran off.

00:35:08.760 --> 00:35:11.200 line:100%
Uncle Ran. Let me sing you a song.

00:35:11.280 --> 00:35:13.320 line:100%
My class sings this song when someone

00:35:13.400 --> 00:35:15.120 line:100%
-is transferring to another school.
-Sure.

00:35:15.960 --> 00:35:18.040 line:100%
<i>Traveling the world</i>

00:35:18.120 --> 00:35:19.360 line:100%
<i>The journey</i>

00:35:19.440 --> 00:35:20.440 line:100%
<i>Is endless</i>

00:35:20.520 --> 00:35:22.240 line:100%
<i>Lost and aimless</i>

00:35:22.320 --> 00:35:24.240 line:100%
<i>One village after another</i>

00:35:24.320 --> 00:35:26.320 line:100%
<i>Staring at the setting sun</i>

00:35:26.400 --> 00:35:27.360 line:100%
<i>Sinking</i>

00:35:27.440 --> 00:35:28.440 line:100%
<i>And rising again</i>

00:35:28.520 --> 00:35:29.440 line:100%
<i>The world</i>

00:35:29.520 --> 00:35:30.440 line:100%
<i>Remains unchanged</i>

00:35:30.520 --> 00:35:32.280 line:100%
<i>The time remains long</i>

00:35:52.800 --> 00:35:54.960 line:100%
You came all the way to Weiyang.

00:35:55.720 --> 00:35:58.840 line:100%
And those old things in the bureau
won't even come to send you off.

00:35:58.920 --> 00:36:01.120 line:100%
They are so heartless.

00:36:02.040 --> 00:36:04.120 line:100%
Sir. They have work to do.

00:36:04.200 --> 00:36:05.800 line:100%
They are in the special task force.

00:36:11.520 --> 00:36:13.440 line:100%
WEIYANG STATION

00:36:13.520 --> 00:36:14.360 line:100%
We're here.

00:36:18.960 --> 00:36:22.400 line:100%
Xiaohe. Let me speak
to Uncle Ran privately.

00:36:40.720 --> 00:36:44.040 line:100%
Have you ever considered staying?

00:36:46.720 --> 00:36:48.440 line:20%
WEIYANG

00:36:51.920 --> 00:36:53.120 line:100%
Maybe next time.

00:36:55.080 --> 00:36:55.960 line:100%
I should go now.

00:37:04.680 --> 00:37:06.960 line:100%
Xiaohe. I'm leaving now.

00:37:17.000 --> 00:37:18.520 line:100%
She doesn't want you to leave either.

00:37:19.440 --> 00:37:20.720 line:100%
But she's stubborn.

00:37:21.400 --> 00:37:22.680 line:100%
She won't show it.

00:37:26.120 --> 00:37:27.040 line:100%
Sir.

00:37:27.800 --> 00:37:28.720 line:100%
Take care.

00:38:18.760 --> 00:38:20.480 line:100%
Why did you leave so soon?

00:38:22.160 --> 00:38:24.400 line:100%
You heartless creature.

00:38:24.480 --> 00:38:26.560 line:100%
You won't even let me finish
what I want to say.

00:38:40.960 --> 00:38:44.360 line:100%
Are you scolding the train or me? Sir.

00:39:01.160 --> 00:39:02.360 line:100%
You decided to stay?

00:39:05.440 --> 00:39:06.280 line:100%
Sir,

00:39:06.800 --> 00:39:08.240 line:100%
you're right.

00:39:08.320 --> 00:39:09.640 line:100%
I cannot run away from it forever.

00:39:10.280 --> 00:39:13.000 line:100%
I'm staying to investigate
the June 30th case with you.

00:39:14.160 --> 00:39:16.280 line:100%
You finally got it through
your thick head.

00:39:16.360 --> 00:39:18.840 line:100%
I knew it. All these years in Beijing

00:39:18.920 --> 00:39:21.240 line:100%
and you still care about this case. Right?

00:39:24.000 --> 00:39:26.120 line:100%
Given your old age,

00:39:26.200 --> 00:39:28.040 line:100%
without my assistance,

00:39:28.120 --> 00:39:29.920 line:100%
you probably
won't be able to find anything.

00:39:30.760 --> 00:39:31.880 line:100%
Good boy.

00:39:31.960 --> 00:39:33.640 line:100%
You still care about me, after all.

00:39:34.760 --> 00:39:36.800 line:100%
Xiaohe. Look.

00:39:36.880 --> 00:39:38.160 line:100%
Guess who's back?

00:39:38.840 --> 00:39:41.440 line:100%
Look. This is my apprentice.

00:39:41.520 --> 00:39:42.760 line:100%
Ran Fangxu.

00:39:43.520 --> 00:39:46.920 line:100%
When we work together, we are invincible.

00:39:47.560 --> 00:39:49.720 line:100%
Peculiar cases or cold cases,

00:39:49.800 --> 00:39:51.200 line:100%
they are nothing to us.

00:39:51.280 --> 00:39:54.760 line:100%
Let alone a tiny Yuanlongli case. Right?

00:39:56.680 --> 00:39:57.520 line:100%
He's my apprentice.

00:39:58.480 --> 00:39:59.320 line:100%
My apprentice.

00:40:31.880 --> 00:40:33.000 line:100%
Wait.

00:40:33.880 --> 00:40:36.040 line:100%
I'm sure you've never left.

00:40:37.040 --> 00:40:39.800 line:100%
When Mrs. Feng's grandson,
Ma Qiang's nephew,

00:40:39.880 --> 00:40:43.640 line:100%
and Li Tieling's son
went missing in Yuanlongli,

00:40:43.720 --> 00:40:46.080 line:100%
you helped me locate them.

00:40:47.640 --> 00:40:50.880 line:100%
Sir. You got it wrong.

00:40:50.960 --> 00:40:52.520 line:100%
I've been teaching in Beijing.

00:41:03.600 --> 00:41:04.720 line:100%
This doesn't make sense.

00:41:05.960 --> 00:41:07.840 line:100%
The train had already departed.

00:41:07.920 --> 00:41:10.320 line:100%
You took the train and left
a long time ago.

00:41:10.400 --> 00:41:11.680 line:100%
How did you return?

00:41:11.760 --> 00:41:13.880 line:100%
How did the train return?